        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Willie the Kid, DJ Drama, Lil Wayne, Lee Bannon\n- Products: DJ Drama albums, Dedication 2, Dedication 3, The Dedication, Never a Dull Moment\n- Concepts: protégé, Gangsta Grillz pentalogy, collaborative EP, mixtapes\n\nFacts:\n- Willie the Kid is most famous for being DJ Drama's protégé.\n- Willie the Kid appeared on both DJ Drama albums and on Lil Wayne's mixtapes Dedication 2 and Dedication 3.\n- Dedication 3 is the sequel to The Dedication and Dedication 2.\n- Dedication 3 became the third installment in Lil Wayne's Gangsta Grillz pentalogy.\n- Never a Dull Moment is a collaborative EP by Willie the Kid and producer Lee Bannon.",
